IR Content:
```yaml
xcpgir_version: "1.0"
rule:
  id: "tainted-url-host"
  kind: taint
  severity: WARNING
  message: "User data flows into the host portion of this manually-constructed URL. This could allow an attacker to send data to their own server, potentially exposing sensitive data such as cookies or authorization information sent with this request. They could also probe internal servers or other resources that the server running this code can access. (This is called server-side request forgery, or SSRF.) Do not allow arbitrary hosts. Instead, create an allowlist for approved hosts, or hardcode the correct host."
  metadata:
    language: python
    category: security
    technology:
      - flask
    cwe: "CWE-918: Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF)"
    owasp: "A10:2021 - Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF)"

sources:
  - id: FLASK_REQUEST
    match:
      node: CALL
      where:
        - op: eq
          left: methodFullName
          right: flask.request.$ANYTHING
  - id: ROUTE_PARAM
    match:
      node: METHOD_PARAMETER_IN
      where:
        - op: eq
          left: context
          right: "@$APP.route(...)"

sinks:
  - id: URL_CONSTRUCTION
    match:
      node: CALL
      where:
        - op: regex
          left: code
          right: "\"\\$URLSTR\" % ...|\"\\$URLSTR\\.format(...)|\"\\$URLSTR\" \\+ ...|f\"\\$URLSTR\\{...\\}...|\\$URL = \"\\$URLSTR\" ... \\$URL \\+= ..."

sanitizers: []

propagations: []
```
Valid: ```yaml
issues:
  - "Sources节点中ROUTE_PARAM的匹配条件不够精确，原规则要求匹配路由参数变量($ROUTEVAR)，但当前实现匹配了所有METHOD_PARAMETER_IN"
  - "Sinks节点中URL_CONSTRUCTION的正则表达式没有正确处理metavariable-pattern和metavariable-regex的情况，缺少对$URLSTR内容的校验"
  - "缺少对$SCHEME变量的校验逻辑，原规则要求在URL构造中必须包含scheme部分(如http://)"

recommendations:
  - "改进ROUTE_PARAM的匹配条件，增加对路由参数变量的精准匹配"
  - "重构URL_CONSTRUCTION的匹配条件，拆分为多个独立的sink模式以对应原规则中的不同情况"
  - "增加对URL scheme部分的校验，确保匹配到包含scheme的URL构造"
```
